{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/4ae98d59d28522fb43a8b6b33e20c285.avif?t=1759450851\" width=920 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P</strong>repare to unleash your inner avian fury in <strong>Birdoo</strong>, an exhilarating indie action game that casts you as a feathered avenger. Tired of the indignities, the shooing, and being dismissed as a mere &quot;flying rat,&quot; you embark on a relentless quest for payback against humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into diverse and vibrant levels, each offering a unique battleground for your revenge. Your mission is simple yet challenging: defeat as many enemies as possible before the clock runs out. Every vanquished foe contributes to your score, propelling you closer to advancing to the next stage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/b2086e9fd3df5e7bc6a871a97048592e.webp?t=1759450851\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a <strong>dozen varied stages</strong>, each presenting you with distinct challenges. From bustling cityscapes, tranquil hiking paths, all the way to outer space every level demands a fresh approach to your aerial assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/00231c584753864e80bfeb52d08de0cf.webp?t=1759450851\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab an arsenal of <strong>power-ups</strong> throughout the levels. Unleash devastating attacks, enhance your speed, or gain temporary invincibility to amplify your path of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/dd430f18fc6dbd4e402df058f662c543.webp?t=1759450851\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your points aren't just for bragging rights. Use them to <strong>unlock </strong>new power ups<strong>\u00a0</strong>enhancing your bird's capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/e5a01ffb46037023ffaca44fd877d196.webp?t=1759450851\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face a <strong>diverse cast of adversaries</strong>, with unique behaviors and vulnerabilities. From the unsuspecting pedestrian to the aggressive exterminator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/5ff76734b31029215935e69aa325d31c.webp?t=1759450851\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and choose the type of pigeon you want to be and <strong>customise</strong> your winged menace with a variety of outfits.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/77aab31c71660a4a87f5250651667bdd.webp?t=1759450851\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against for the highest score<strong>\u00a0</strong>to assert your aerial supremacy. With every successful stage and high score, climb the <strong>leaderboard</strong> and prove that you are the ultimate feathered menace. Show humanity, and your fellow birds, who truly is the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enough with being called a \u201cflying rat\u201d and shooed away! It\u2019s payback time! Soar with grace, strike with fury, and show your enemies who the boss is.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a formidable <strong>feathered avenger</strong>, an unstoppable force of nature; your vengeance will be swift and absolute!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3488620?t=1759450851","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3488620?t=1759450851","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/d16712e886a84d18be3181eca3ea7d986c2d3fb7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759450851","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/d167