specting pedestrian to the aggressive exterminator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/5ff76734b31029215935e69aa325d31c.webp?t=1759450851\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and choose the type of pigeon you want to be and <strong>customise</strong> your winged menace with a variety of outfits.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/77aab31c71660a4a87f5250651667bdd.webp?t=1759450851\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against for the highest score<strong>\u00a0</strong>to assert your aerial supremacy. With every successful stage and high score, climb the <strong>leaderboard</strong> and prove that you are the ultimate feathered menace. Show humanity, and your fellow birds, who truly is the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enough with being called a \u201cflying rat\u201d and shooed away! It\u2019s payback time! Soar with grace, strike with fury, and show your enemies who the boss is.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a formidable <strong>feathered avenger</strong>, an unstoppable force of nature; your vengeance will be swift and absolute!</p>","developers":["Runny Bird Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":